 r←Test_StdForm_010(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;parms;n;globalParms;MyGuiParms
⍝ Bring up a form and add 3 tabs to it
 r←∆Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 CreateGlobalParms
 globalParms←⎕NS MyGuiParms
 parms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.StdForm.CreateParms
 :If ⍬ ⍬≡parms.size
     parms.size←400 500
 :EndIf
 n←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.StdForm.Create globalParms parms
 n←(45 0)#.APLGUI.APLGUI.StdForm.AddTabs n('First' 'Second' 'Third')
 ⎕DL 1
 ⎕NQ n.∆Form'Close'

 r←∆OK
